[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10801.269, "timestamp": "03:00:01", "text": "哦，等等。这就是流媒体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10804.15, "timestamp": "03:00:04", "text": "哦，等等。 [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10809.03, "timestamp": "03:00:09", "text": "就是那条溪流。好的。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10812.389, "timestamp": "03:00:12", "text": "呃，我明白了，显然是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10814.389, "timestamp": "03:00:14", "text": "有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10817.59, "timestamp": "03:00:17", "text": "未公开的流媒体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10820.55, "timestamp": "03:00:20", "text": "我有一个我以前有这个等待"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10823.11, "timestamp": "03:00:23", "text": "房间那玩意儿，以前总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10827.99, "timestamp": "03:00:27", "text": "计划在遥远的未来进行，大概两年后吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10831.59, "timestamp": "03:00:31", "text": "叫“是啊”。这就是缩略图。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10835.91, "timestamp": "03:00:35", "text": "我没事。聪明的。这很明智。笑话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10837.745, "timestamp": "03:00:37", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10838.63, "timestamp": "03:00:38", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10840.79, "timestamp": "03:00:40", "text": "好了，（喘息）让我把这个做完就走。"}]